  Authentication path index tests PASSED!

Demonstrating OTS + Merkle concept...
  In a real MSS (Merkle Signature Scheme):
    1. Generate N OTS key pairs
    2. Build Merkle tree from OTS public keys
    3. Public key = Merkle root
    4. To sign: use next unused OTS key + auth path
    5. To verify: verify OTS sig, recompute path to root

  Key insight: Each OTS key can only be used ONCE
  The Merkle tree allows compact verification of many OTS keys

  Tree of height h allows 2^h signatures
    h=20 -> ~1 million signatures
    h=10 -> 1024 signatures

